        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Kanloumeipu jeih tei luangkei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kanloumeipu jeih 6$% luangkei,",
            "Apap guai khiu than khang;",
            "Kapi thanmei bumkei louna,",
            "Abumang kanlou the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Laujiu Nah njangmei,",
            "Kalvari khou khang lou;",
            "Laujiu Nah thei kanmei ringthao datthe,",
            "Ata kanloumei e.",
            "",
            "2. Apap geimei njianlouna,",
            "Kross rukhou khang louna;",
            "Ngam makmei ata njian lou the,",
            "Tingsang ringmei lakhang.",
            "",
            "3. Nei rui kalun jao ngam mak ge,",
            "Kariu tipat mak ge;",
            "Kamei rui apap guai phung lou,",
            "Kross khou thei pui kan khou.",
            "",
            "4. Aini api bum kei lana,",
            "Pou rui thei loumei kumma;",
            "Akhang khang lou mei 6$% ninga,",
            "Pou ta ningtan lak ge.",
            "",
            "5. Amikdui hei luang kei sini,",
            "Khang loumei nthuk ge;",
            "Apum hei tipat ngam sini,",
            "Hei 6$% rui bui mak ge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
